%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Recovery Action Completed]) --> Pass{Did the original<br/>test now pass?}

    Pass -->|No| Failed[FAILED_RECOVERY]
    Pass -->|Yes| Side{Were new failures<br/>introduced?}

    Side -->|Yes| Failed
    Side -->|No| Consistent{Is evidence still<br/>consistent with RCA?}

    Consistent -->|No| Uncertain[UNCERTAIN]
    Consistent -->|Yes| Conf{Is confidence<br/>still high enough?}

    Conf -->|No| Uncertain
    Conf -->|Yes| Success[SUCCESS]

    Failed --> Limits{Investigation / Retry<br/>limits reached?}
    Uncertain --> Limits

    Limits -->|No| Replan[Return to Orchestrator<br/>for additional investigation]
    Limits -->|Yes| Escalate[ESCALATE TO HUMAN]

    Success --> Report1[Final Diagnosis:<br/>RESOLVED]
    Escalate --> Report2[Final Diagnosis:<br/>ESCALATED + Full Evidence]

    style Success fill:#c6f6d5,stroke:#276749
    style Report1 fill:#c6f6d5,stroke:#276749
    style Failed fill:#fed7d7,stroke:#c53030
    style Uncertain fill:#fefcbf,stroke:#975a16
    style Escalate fill:#feb2b2,stroke:#c53030
    style Report2 fill:#feb2b2,stroke:#c53030
